<template><main class="qna-detail-page"><div class="page-shell qna-detail-shell"><button class="article-back" @click="router.push('/qna')"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> 문의 목록</button><div v-if="isLoading" class="community-loading"><span></span><p>문의 내용을 불러오고 있습니다.</p></div><template v-else-if="qna._id"><article class="question-card"><header><div><span class="qna-category">{{qna.category}}</span><span :class="['qna-status',{answered:qna.answer?.content}]">{{qna.answer?.content?'답변완료':'답변대기'}}</span></div><h1>{{qna.title}}</h1><p>{{maskedAuthor}} · {{formatDate(qna.createdAt)}} · 조회 {{qna.views||0}}</p></header><div v-if="qna.productName" class="qna-selected-product"><img :src="qna.imagePath||'/img/defalut_product.png'" alt="문의 상품" /><div><small>문의 상품</small><strong>{{qna.productName}}</strong></div></div><div class="question-content">{{qna.content}}</div></article><article v-if="qna.answer?.content" class="answer-card"><header><span><i class="fa-solid fa-a"></i></span><div><p>카리나벨 답변</p><time>{{formatDate(qna.answer.createdAt)}}</time></div></header><div>{{qna.answer.content}}</div></article><div v-else class="answer-waiting"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i><div><strong>답변을 준비하고 있습니다.</strong><p>확인 후 빠르게 답변해 드리겠습니다.</p></div></div></template><div v-else class="community-empty"><i class="fa-regular fa-comments"></i><h2>문의를 찾을 수 없습니다.</h2></div></div></main></template>
<script setup>import{onMounted,ref}from"vue";import{useRoute,useRouter}from"vue-router";import QnaService from"@/api/QnaService";const route=useRoute(),router=useRouter(),qna=ref({}),maskedAuthor=ref(""),isLoading=ref(true);const formatDate=value=>value?new Date(value).toLocaleDateString("ko-KR"):"-";onMounted(async()=>{try{const response=await QnaService.getQnaDetail(route.params.id,localStorage.getItem("token"));qna.value=response.data;maskedAuthor.value=response.data.userId?.fullName?.replace(/.$/,"*")||"회원"}catch(error){console.error(error)}finally{isLoading.value=false}});</script>
<style>.qna-detail-page{padding:50px 0 110px;background:var(--color-warm)}.qna-detail-shell{max-width:900px}.question-card,.answer-card{background:#fff}.question-card>header{padding:40px;border-bottom:1px solid #312b2e}.question-card h1{margin:13px 0;font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:400}.question-card header>p{color:#a0979b;font-size:.62rem}.question-content{min-height:220px;padding:40px;color:#5d5559;font-size:.82rem;line-height:2;white-space:pre-line}.answer-card{margin-top:18px;border-top:3px solid var(--color-brand)}.answer-card>header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:25px 35px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line)}.answer-card header>span{width:34px;height:34px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;color:#fff;background:var(--color-brand)}.answer-card header p{font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700}.answer-card time{color:#a2989d;font-size:.58rem}.answer-card>div{padding:35px;color:#5f575b;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.9;white-space:pre-line}.answer-waiting{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin-top:18px;padding:28px 35px;background:#eee9e6;color:#857b80}.answer-waiting>i{font-size:1.3rem}.answer-waiting strong{color:#5d5559;font-size:.75rem}.answer-waiting p{font-size:.63rem}@media(max-width:600px){.question-card>header,.question-content{padding:28px 20px}.answer-card>header,.answer-card>div{padding:24px 20px}}
</style>
